  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 1376f052a41f43242b6634233346e3e4, type: 3}
  m_Name: Right6.1
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::DialogueLine
  speakerName: ROXANNE
  line: There's a print on that door that isn't mine. A ring impression. Distinctive
    shape - I have the comparison here. The same ring left a mark on the office window
    the night Valentino died. Same hand. Same ring. Someone was in that basement.
    Someone who had been close enough to me, long enough, to know how I form my letters.
    Someone who has been in this building all night. Does nobody else see her?
